# AutoBuilder deployment — app env vars
# --------------------------------------
# These are passed to the running container via --env-file. No stripping, no
# filtering — what you put here is what the app sees at runtime.
#
# Build-time injection has two sources, both defined in service.json:
#   - build.args      glob list, matched against keys here (e.g. VITE_*)
#   - build.args_map  explicit { KEY: "value" } map for static values
# Useful for frontend frameworks that inline env vars at compile time
# (Vite, Next.js, Create React App).

# VITE_API_URL='https://api.example.com'
# DATABASE_URL='postgres://user:pass@postgres:5432/mydb'
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL='https://example.com'
